title: mf slow replay
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Slow log]]
kind: reference
summary: Run a query again and show where its time goes, now: the newest logged query, the one with that id, or one typed with -q. Not itself logged

Runs a logged query again, now, and prints its breakdown:
[[Diagnosing a slow operation]]. Given an id, the entry `mf slow` lists with it (or
a unique prefix of it, found however old); without one, the newest logged query; with
`-q`, any query, asked as the first page of a list asks for it (100 results and
its count).
